# Build-context exclusions for the asmita image (asmita.Dockerfile).
# Mirrors asmita/.gitignore: dependencies are reinstalled by npm ci in the
# image, dev artifacts are regenerated, and .env* files must NEVER enter a
# build context (a developer's local secrets are not the image's business).

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-old-*
**/dist
**/.vinext
**/.wrangler
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/.lighthouseci
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
asmita/src/generated
asmita/public/c2pa
asmita/public/ort
asmita/public/human
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
.git
crawler
tools
asmita/tests/e2e/test-results
